000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.          TCORITM.
000400 AUTHOR.              ANDREW T LEPERA.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.        DEC 12,1978.
000600 DATE-COMPILED.
000700*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
000800*SECURITY.
000900*REMARKS.
001000*    PROCESSING OUTLINE.
001100*    1.  THE SCREEN REQUESTS ALL THE DATA NEEDED TO MODIFY THE
001200*        RECEIPT INTO STOREROOM.
001300*    2.  ALL THE DATA IS VERIFIED.
001400*    3.  A PRINTOUT OF THE RECEIPTS INTO STOREROOM IS WRITTEN.
001500*    4.  DATABASE UPDATED AS FOLLOWS:
001600*        -DPOITEM (RECEIVER ENTRY)-QTY STORED, DATE (IF BLANK).
001700*        -DPOITEM (ACCUMULATOR)   -QTY STORED.
001800*        -MSTORERM  --  ONHAND, INDIVIDUAL ONHAND, ACTIVITY DATE.
001900*        -DDAILYTC  --  A 325 RECORD FOR EACH ITEM.
002000*
002100*   THE FOLLOWING CHANGES WERE MADE ON NOVEMBER 2, 1981.
002200*        1.  STR-PADDING WAS DIVIDED INTO TWO ITEMS, AND
002300*            A FILLER OF PIC X(100) WAS ADDED AFTER BUF-
002400*            MSTORERM.
002500*        2.  A PROMPT FOR PRINTER LOCATION WAS ADDED TO
002600*            THE SCREEN FOR DATA-ENTRY. (MPLTINFO WAS ADDED).
002700*        3.  CHANGED AN INCORRECT MESSAGE CONCERNING
002800*            ADJUSTED QUANTITY BEING BELOW ZERO.
002900*            LYNN M. BUNN
003000*
003100*   ON DECEMBER 8, 1981, THE FOLLOWING PRINT LOCATIONS
003200*   WERE ADDED;
003300*            PRT-LOC                 PRINTER-NUM
003400*              IP (INTERPLANT)           14
003500*              01                        13
003600*
003700*
003800*   ON JANUARY 5, 1982, A PRINT LOCATION WAS ADDED FOR UNION CITY.
003900*     STORES01 FOR U.C. WILL GO TO PRINTER-NUMBER 3.  LMB
004000*
004100*
004200*   ON FEBRUARY 2, 1982, THE STORES01 PRINT LOCATION FOR UNION CITY
004300*     WAS CHANGED TO MATCONT (TO GO TO PRINTER-NUM 10) LMB
004400*
004500*   ON JULY 7, 1982, SEVERAL CHANGES WERE MADE.  THE SCREEN WAS
004600*     TAKEN OUT OF DEL AND PUT INTO THE PROGRAM LOGIC.  THE
004700*     DATABASE BUFFERS WERE UPDATED.  ADDED PRINT LOCATIONS FOR
004800*     THE ADDITIONAL AKRON PLANTS.  ADDED INSTRUCTIONS TO THE
004900*     SCREEN.  LMB.
005000*
005100*   ON AUGUST 30, 1982, ADDED PLANTS 112 AND 113 TO THE "IF STATE-
005200*     MENTS" FOR THE PRINT LOCATIONS.   LMB.
005300*
005400*    ON JANUARY 24, 1983, MADE A FIX TO ACCOMODATE FAYETTE-
005500*      VILLE'S 5 BTYE RECEIVING SLIP.  ALSO ADDED AN ERROR
005600*      MESSAGE IF THE QUANTITY STORED IS GREATER THAN THE
005700*      QUANTITY DELIVERED.  LMB.
005800*
005900*    IN FEBRUARY, 1983, CHANGED PRT-LOC STUFF.  INSTEAD OF ENTERING
006000*    A MNEMONIC PRT-LOC SUCH AS "IP" OR "M4", THE USER WILL SIMPLY
006100*    ENTER THE SPOOLER NUMBRER.  IF LEFT BLANK, WILL DEFAULT TO
006200*    STOREROOM (08).  THIS WILL END THE NEED TO CHANGE PRT-LOCS
006300*    WHICH ARE HARD-CODED INTO THE PROGRAM. CIH.
006400*
006500*    ON FEBRUARY 4, 1983, ADDED A CHECK TO MAKE SURE THE REC-
006600*    EIVING SLIP NUMBER IS ENTERED. (AKRON EXECUTED THIS PRO-
006700*    GRAM WITH THE PURCHASE ORDER NUMBER).  LMB.
006800*
006900*    ON MARCH 10, 1983, CHANGED THE MPORCV STATUS TO FOUR BYTES.
007000*    LMB.
007100*
007200*    ON AUGUST 22, 1984, ADDED INPUT CHECK.  IF ITEM IS A
007300*    DIRECT DELIVERY, MODIFICATION WILL NOT BE ALLOWED.  -VWD
007400*
007500*    ON JANUARY 4, 1985, MADE THE FOLLOWING CHANGES:
007600*      1. CONVERTED TO "VIEW"
007700*      2. ADDED CALLS TO "TTERMTYP" TO DETERMINE TERMINAL
007800*         TYPE, "TSHWRDFM" TO HANDLE FUNTION KEYS, "TUMCF"
007900*         TO DO UNIT OF MEASURE CONVERSIONS, AND "TBLOWUP"
008000*         TO HANDLE FATAL ERROR CONDITIONS.
008100*      3. FIXED SOME ERRORS IN HANDLING OF UNIT OF
008200*         MEASURE CONVERSIONS (OLD VERSION ENDED UP WITH
008300*         A NEGATIVE QUANTITY STORED IF CERTAIN DATA WAS
008400*         ENTERED).
008500*      4. ADDED THE RECEIVING SLIP INQUIRY (f1) AND MATERIAL
008600*         STATUS INQUIRY (f2) TO THE PROGRAM.  THESE ARE CALLS
008700*         TO "TMTLSTAT" AND "SINQRSI".
008800*     CIH.
008900*
009000*    ON JANUARY 7, 1985, MADE THE FOLLOWING CHANGES:
009100*      1. ADDED ROUTINE TO GET THE PO PRICE, AND PUT IT IN THE
009200*         325 TRANSACTION, IN ORDER TO BE CONSISTENT WITH THE
009300*         RECEIPT INTO STOREROOM PROGRAM.
009400*      2. ADDED A "CORRECTION INDICATOR" FIELD TO THE 325
009500*         TRANSACTION.  IF THIS FIELD IS A 'C', THAT IDENTIFIES
009600*         THE TRANSACTION AS A CORRECTION, RATHER THAN A NORMAL
009700*         RECEIPT INTO THE STOREROOM.
009800*
009900*
010000*    ON JANUARY 21, 1985, ADDED A DUMMY PARAMETER TO THE CALL
010100*    OF THE SUBPROGRAM "TMTLSTAT" - MATERIAL STATUS INQUIRY.
010200*    THIS IS A DUMMY CORPORATE CODE PARAMETER - USED BY PROGRAMS
010300*    THAT MAY PASS THE CORP CODE TO THE INQUIRY, THUS BYPASSING
010400*    THE CORPORATE CODE ENTRY SCREEN.  IF THE PASSED CODE IS SPACES,
010500*    THE CODE ENTRY SCREEN IS BROUGHT, AND THE CODE PARAMETER IS
010600*    IGNORED.  CIH.
010700*
010800*    ON APRIL 24, 1985; ADDED TDATECHK ROUTINE TO GET CORRECT
010900*                 US/EUROPEAN DATE FORMATS.  -B. WINTER.
011000*
011100*    ON JULY 28, 1985, TCORITM WAS MODIFIED TO DISALLOW A
011200*    MODIFIED RECEIPT IF AN ITEM ON THAT RECIEPT IS FROZEN FOR
011300*    INVENTORY.
011400*
011500*    ON OCTOBER 7, 1985 - UPDATED THE RECEIVING SLIP INQUIRY IN
011600*    THIS PROGRAM TO CALL THE CURRENT VERSION AND TO USE THE
011700*    FORMFILE FROM THE INQUIRY INSTEAD OF AN OLD VERSION THAT
011800*    WAS COMPILED WITH THIS PROGRAM.  - BARBARA WINTER.
011900*
012000*   10/ 7/85  ADDED CALLS TO FINDJCW, NLAPPEND, CATOPEN, AND *
012100*             CATCLOSE IN ORDER TO ACCOMODATE THE NATIVE     *
012200*             LANGUAGE SUPPORT FACILITY.  ADDED LINKAGES AND *
012300*             ALSO MADE THE CHANGE TO THE FORMFILE NAMES.    *
012400*             CHANGED ALL REFERENCES OF TSCRPRNT TO TSCRPRT2,*
012500*             TDATECHK TO TDATECK2.                          *
012600*             THIS WAS TO INCORPORATE THE NATIVE LANGUAGE    *
012700*             SUPPORT VERSIONS OF THESE SUBROUTINES.         *
012800*                                    PD RAGLOW               *
012900**************************************************************
      *C 09/19/94  JEFF BUNGO
      *C   WRITE TRANSACTION 341 IF AN ITEM HAD A CHAT NUMBER
      *C   ASSIGNED TO IT.  THE TC 341 WILL BE PASSED TO THE
      *C   CHESS CORPORATE SYSTEM.
      *C
      *C 08/16/95  JEFF BUNGO
      *C   ALLOW KELLY ONLY USERS TO ENTER A PRAPS NUMBER INSTEAD
      *C   OF A CSIS RECEIVING SLIP NUMBER.  IF BOTH ARE ENTERED,
      *C   THE PRAPS NUMBER TAKES PRECEDENCE.  INDICATOR 88 CONTROLS
      *C   WHETHER OR NOT THE LITERALS AND PRAPS VALUE ARE DISPLAYED
      *C   ON THE SCREEN TO THE USER (SET TO ON FOR KELLY).
      *C
      *C 06/10/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C   EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C   INCLUDE CENTURY FOR STOREROOM ACTIVITY DATE
      *C   AND RECEIVING SLIP ITEM STORED DATE.
      *C
      *C SEPTEMBER 3, 1997  JEFF BUNGO
      *C      IF STORES RECEIPTS INTERFACE WITH AN EXTERNAL
      *C      SYSTEM (APPLICATION) AND ALL MATERIAL IS TO BE
      *C      AUTOSTORED (BASED ON MPLTINFO KEY SRX), THEN
      *C      MARK CODE AS AUTO STORE AND DO NOT ALLOW BACK OFF
      *C      OF STORES RECEIPT WITH THIS PROGRAM.  ALSO CALL THE EXTERNAL
      *C      INTERFACE PROGRAM TO PASS THE DATA (RECEIVER,
      *C      ITEM NUMBER, CODE, QTY, UM, DATE, AND TIME).
      *C
      *C
      *C MARCH 30, 1998  JEFF BUNGO
      *C      IF CODE IS FRANCHISED OWNED AND VENDOR IS A FRANCHISE
      *C      VENDOR, THEN ONLY ALLOW ADJUSTMENT TO A FRANCHISE BIN
      *C      AND PLACE FRANCHISE ID IN THE 325 TC.


013200
