060000*---------- CALL SUBPROG WHICH WILL HANDLE THE SHOWFORM,
060100*---------- READFIELDS, SPECIAL KEY LOGIC (FLOP SCREEN, PRINT
060200*---------- SCREEN, REFRESH, ETC), AND VIEW EDITS.
           PERFORM 9999-RESET-MPORCV-PO-O.
           PERFORM 9999-RESET-MSTORERM-CD-O.
           PERFORM 9999-RESET-DPOITEM-PO-O.
           PERFORM 9999-RESET-DRCVITEM-PO-O.
060400     MOVE 5 TO SRF-KEYSET.
           IF SRF-MPLTINFO-COMPANY = "211" OR "281" OR "285"
               MOVE B"1" TO IND(88)
           ELSE
               MOVE B"0" TO IND(88).
           MOVE DE-FIELDS-1 TO DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 9989-WS-X.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC TO DE-FIELDS-1.
           IF MESSAGE-BUFFER-1 NOT = SPACES
               PERFORM 9954-SETERROR
               GO TO 6110-SHOWFORM.

      *------GET THE TABLE OF MAJOR GROUPS TO AUTOMATICALLY STORE
      *------UPON RECEIPT FROM THE MPLTINFO FILE.
           IF AUTOSTORE-TABLE = SPACES
               MOVE "OVSH" TO PLT-ARG
               PERFORM 9999-GETKEY-MPLTINFO-PK-I
               MOVE MPLTINFO-RM-STORED-TABLE TO AUTOSTORE-TABLE.

061100     IF VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL EXIT-PROGRAM
061200         GO TO 6990-MAIN-X.
