061500*------- READ THE SCREEN.
061600     IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1
061700         MOVE VIEW-LASTKEY  TO  SAVE-VIEW-LASTKEY
061800         PERFORM 9961-AUTOREAD
061900         PERFORM 9964-FINISHFORM
062000         MOVE SAVE-VIEW-LASTKEY  TO  VIEW-LASTKEY.
062100
