062500         PERFORM 9952-GETBUFFER
062600         PERFORM 9070-CALL-TMTLSTAT
               PERFORM 9953-PUTBUFFER
062900         GO TO 6110-SHOWFORM.
063000
           PERFORM 9952-GETBUFFER.

      *-------CONVERT PRAPS NUMBER TO CSIS RECEIVER
           IF DE1-PRAPS NOT = "000000" AND DE1-PRAPS NOT = SPACES
               MOVE DE1-PRAPS TO PORCVSEQ OF MPORCV-REC-I
               READ MPORCV-I INTO BUF-MPORCV
                  INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
               END-READ
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                 MOVE  18 TO LANG-SETNUM
                 MOVE  65 TO LANG-MSGNUM
                 PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
                 MOVE DE1-PRAPS TO  MSG-FLD
                 MOVE 5 TO FIELD-NUMBER
                 PERFORM 9954-SETERROR
                 GO TO 6110-SHOWFORM
               ELSE
                 MOVE M-PO-RCV-NO-2-8 TO DE1-PO
                 MOVE M-PO-RCV-NO-9-11 TO DE1-RLSE
                 MOVE M-PO-RCV-NO-12-14 TO DE1-RS
               END-IF
           END-IF.
