064300     ELSE
064400        MOVE DE1-RLSE           TO WS-RLSE.
064500     MOVE PO-RLSE-RS            TO PO-ARG.
           MOVE PO-ARG TO PO-ARG-ALL.
           PERFORM 9999-DBGET7-MPORCV-PO-O.
064800     IF COND-WORD = 17
064900        MOVE  16 TO LANG-SETNUM
065000        MOVE  45 TO LANG-MSGNUM
