065300        MOVE 1                   TO FIELD-NUMBER
065400        PERFORM 9954-SETERROR
065500        GO TO 6110-SHOWFORM
065600     ELSE
065700        IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
065800           MOVE "DBGET MPORCV TCORITM 6110" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
065900           PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

      *-----GET DPORECD FOR THE VENDOR CODE
           MOVE PO-ARG TO PO-ARG-ALL.
           PERFORM 9999-DBFIND-DPORECD-PO-I.
           PERFORM 9999-DBGET5-DPORECD-PO-I.
      *-----CHECK VENDOR CODE FOR FRANCHISE VENDOR
      *--------05/15/97, SET FLAG FOR FRANCHISE PO BASED ON VENDOR CODE
           IF FRAN-TABLE NOT = SPACES
               SET FRAN-IDX TO 1
               SEARCH FRAN-ENTRY
                 AT END
                     MOVE SPACES TO FRAN-PO-ID
                 WHEN FRAN-VEN-CODE(FRAN-IDX) = PO-VEN-CODE
                     MOVE FRAN-ID(FRAN-IDX) TO FRAN-PO-ID
               END-SEARCH
           ELSE
               MOVE SPACES TO FRAN-PO-ID
           END-IF.
