084800*---------- CALL SUBPROG TO CONVERT ENTERED QUANTITY INTO
084900*---------- STOREROOM UNIT OF MEASURE.
085000*---------- NOTE: SPACES IS PASSED IN RET-CODE TO THE SUBPROG
085100*---------- TO INDICATE THAT QUANTITIES ARE BEING CONVERTED
085200
085300     MOVE SPACES        TO  RET-CODE.
085400     MOVE DE-QTY        TO  UMCF-SOURCE-QTY.
085500     MOVE DE-UM         TO  UMCF-SOURCE-UM.
