087200           RCV-QTY-STORED - ADJUSTMENT-QTY-RECEIPT-UM
087300     ELSE
087400         COMPUTE NEW-QTY-STORED =
087500           RCV-QTY-STORED + ADJUSTMENT-QTY-RECEIPT-UM.
087600
