               CALL "BEXTSTRIFC" USING RS-WS
                                       ITM-NUMBER
                                       CODE-ARG
                                       ADJUSTMENT-QTY-STR-UM
                                       STR-UM
                                       DATE-YMD-OUT
                                       DATE-UNFORMATTED-TIME-OUT.

           PERFORM 9940-UNLOCK.
