       8000-CHECK-IF-AUTOSTORE-ITEM.
      *------IF STORE RECEIPT INTERFACES WITH EXTERNAL SYSTEM AND
      *------   ALL MATERIALS TO BE AUTO STORED THEN SET SWITCH TO Y
      *------   JSB, 9/3/97 FOR DES MOINES
           IF SAVE-EXTSYS = "Y" AND SAVE-EXTAUTO = "Y"
               MOVE "Y"                  TO  AUTOSTORE-ITEM
               GO TO 8000-EXIT.

           SET I TO 1.
           SEARCH AUTOSTORE-AREA
                  AT END  MOVE "N" TO AUTOSTORE-ITEM
                      GO TO 8000-EXIT
                  WHEN AUTOSTORE-MAJOR-GROUP(I) = ITEM-MAJOR-GROUP
                      GO TO 8000-FOUND-GROUP.
       8000-FOUND-GROUP.
           MOVE AUTOSTORE-INDICATOR(I)   TO AUTOSTORE-ITEM.

       8000-EXIT.   EXIT.
