       9999-RESET-MPORCV-PO-O.
           MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO PORCVNO OF MPORCV-PO-REC-O.
           START MPORCV-PO-O KEY > PORCVNO OF MPORCV-PO-REC-O
               INVALID KEY MOVE "00" TO FILE-STATUS.

       9999-RESET-MSTORERM-CD-O.
           MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-CD-REC-O.
           START MSTORERM-CD-O KEY > CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-CD-REC-O
               INVALID KEY MOVE "00" TO FILE-STATUS.

       9999-OPEN-STUFF.
           OPEN I-O DISPLAY-FILE.
           OPEN INPUT DPORECD-PO-I          MPLTINFO-PK-I        .
           OPEN I-O   MPORCV-PO-O           DRCVITEM-PO-O
