                      DDAILYTC-DT-O                              .
           OPEN INPUT MPORCV-I.

       9999-CLOSE-STUFF.
           CLOSE DISPLAY-FILE
           CLOSE      MPORCV-PO-O           DRCVITEM-PO-O
                      DPOITEM-PO-O          MSTORERM-CD-O
                      DPORECD-PO-I          DDAILYTC-DT-O
                      MPLTINFO-PK-I         MPORCV-I             .
       9999-GETKEY-MPLTINFO-PK-I.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE PLT-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-PK-REC-I.
           READ MPLTINFO-PK-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "23"
               MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD
               IF HANDLE-BLOWUP-FLAG = "Y"
                   MOVE "GETKEY ERR 9999-GETKEY-MPLTINFO-PK-I"
                       TO BU-MSG-AREA
                   PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

143800
143900 6990-MAIN-X.
144000     EXIT.
